          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Amazia wi Ivuyuda yamenya mihiga 15 inyima wi likuza liu mwami Jehoashi mwana muyaayi wa Jehoahazi mwami wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vindu vindi viosi via Amazia yakola kutura mu litanga kuduuka ku keheri chi liamiiha lilie, viang'odwa mu kitabu cha makuva ga Avami vi Ivuyuda na Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura ing'inga yeyo, lwa Amazia yagirung'ana naleka Yahova, avasigu veve vamwikiruka nivenya kumwiita mu Jerusalemi. Hene yaho, yiruka nazia mu lidaala linene lia Lakishi, navuzwa avasigu veve vamulonda ni vamwitira yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muviri gwigwe gwaagingirwa ku barasi nigoletwa mu Jerusalemi, ma naateevwa harara na vaguuga veve mu virindwa viu vwami mu lidaala linene lia Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
